{"3903140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyber Boxing Arena", "steam_appid": 3903140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Boxing Arena is a digitalized-styled boxing simulator where players can participate in intense &amp; action packed boxing bouts against the computer or another player via multiplayer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAIN FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can play as or against 9 different characters, each character having specific stats for the player's preference of choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as  single player against the computer &amp; multiplayer (Requires 2 Game Controllers).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose between 3 different game modes. (Exhibition, Professional, or Practice)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multilingual interface and voice-overs. (Currently supports up to 11 different languages)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for Mouse &amp; Keyboard or a USB Joystick Controller Input.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User Interface is designed for multiple aspect ratios &amp; screen resolutions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exhibition</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boxing match that will affect only your win streak but not your record.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boxing match that will affect both your record and win streak.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training mode design to improve your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game":